OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear
OL,6,Fintervals this evening, though cloud
OL,7,Fthickening overnight. Remaining dry.
OL,8,FStrong winds at first towards the
OL,9,Fcoast will ease. Though milder than
OL,10,FFriday night, a patchy frost still
OL,11,Flikely.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FEarly bright spells, otherwise
OL,14,Fcloudy with rain and showers, becoming
OL,15,Fheavy and persistent at times. Lighter
OL,16,Fwinds until the evening, when coastal
OL,17,Fgales are possible. Feeling cold and
OL,18,Funpleasant.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
