OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FBright, but cold on Monday, with the
OL,7,Fodd wintry shower. Rain and possible
OL,8,Fhill snow arriving later and into
OL,9,FTuesday, before colder, sunnier
OL,10,Fweather returns for midweek.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
